&lt;p style="margin-left: 56px; line-height: 16px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;（会計上の見積りの不確実性について）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 56px; line-height: 16px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;「第５　経理の状況　１　連結財務諸表等　注記事項（追加情報）」をご参照ください。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 64px; line-height: 16px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:NotesAdditionalInformationFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
